{"id":"572b333bf180a369","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-measure7-disintegration-kernel.md","title":"ZFC Measure7 Disintegration Kernel","display":"df-zfc-measure7-disintegration-kernel — ZFC Measure7 Disintegration Kernel","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure7-disintegration-kernel","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure7-disintegration-kernel"],"display":"df-zfc-measure7-disintegration-kernel — ZFC Measure7 Disintegration Kernel","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-integral.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure7-disintegration-kernel"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure7-disintegration-kernel</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure7-disintegration-kernel — ZFC Measure7 Disintegration Kernel"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4884f45058a56aac\" href=\"?note=4884f45058a56aac\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-integral.md\">../batch02/58-df-integral.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,\\mu,\\nu,f,K\\in V\">\\(X,Y,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,\\mu,\\nu,f,K\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a>, and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\int_Y K(y)(E)\\,d\\nu(y)\">\\(\\int_Y K(y)(E)\\,d\\nu(y)\\)</span> is the nonnegative Lebesgue integral from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4884f45058a56aac\" href=\"?note=4884f45058a56aac\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-integral.md\">../batch02/58-df-integral.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProbabilityKernel}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ProbabilityKernel}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7DisintegrationKernel}_S\\subseteq V^8\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7DisintegrationKernel}_S\\subseteq V^8\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}probability\\text{-}kernel}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProbabilityKernel}_S(K,Y,\\mathcal B,X,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(K,Y,\\operatorname{ran}(K))\\land\n\\forall y\\in Y\\;(\\mathrm{Measure}_S(K(y),X,\\mathcal A)\\land K(y)(X)=1)\\land\n\\forall E\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\forall q\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\n\\{y\\in Y:K(y)(E)&gt;q\\}\\in\\mathcal B\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}probability\\text{-}kernel}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ProbabilityKernel}_S(K,Y,\\mathcal B,X,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(K,Y,\\operatorname{ran}(K))\\land\n\\forall y\\in Y\\;(\\mathrm{Measure}_S(K(y),X,\\mathcal A)\\land K(y)(X)=1)\\land\n\\forall E\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\forall q\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\n\\{y\\in Y:K(y)(E)&gt;q\\}\\in\\mathcal B\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}disintegration\\text{-}kernel} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7DisintegrationKernel}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu,f,K)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu,Y,\\mathcal B)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\n\\forall C\\in\\mathcal B\\;(f^{-1}[C]\\in\\mathcal A\\land\\nu(C)=\\mu(f^{-1}[C]))\\land\n\\mathrm{ProbabilityKernel}_S(K,Y,\\mathcal B,X,\\mathcal A)\\land\n\\{y\\in Y:K(y)(X\\setminus f^{-1}[\\{y\\}])\\neq0\\}\\in\\mathcal B\\land\n\\nu(\\{y\\in Y:K(y)(X\\setminus f^{-1}[\\{y\\}])\\neq0\\})=0\\land\n\\forall E\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\left(\\mu(E)=\\int_Y K(y)(E)\\,d\\nu(y)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}disintegration\\text{-}kernel} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7DisintegrationKernel}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu,f,K)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu,Y,\\mathcal B)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\n\\forall C\\in\\mathcal B\\;(f^{-1}[C]\\in\\mathcal A\\land\\nu(C)=\\mu(f^{-1}[C]))\\land\n\\mathrm{ProbabilityKernel}_S(K,Y,\\mathcal B,X,\\mathcal A)\\land\n\\{y\\in Y:K(y)(X\\setminus f^{-1}[\\{y\\}])\\neq0\\}\\in\\mathcal B\\land\n\\nu(\\{y\\in Y:K(y)(X\\setminus f^{-1}[\\{y\\}])\\neq0\\})=0\\land\n\\forall E\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\left(\\mu(E)=\\int_Y K(y)(E)\\,d\\nu(y)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fiber concentration is required <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span>-almost everywhere, not at every point; the pushforward, kernel measurability, and nonnegative-integral source are explicit.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-integral.md","status":"resolved","id":"4884f45058a56aac","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-integral.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$, $\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}$, and $\\mathrm{Measure}_S$ are as in [[../batch16/58-df-functio